  "title": "Tile Companions",
  "description": "Bind a Region, an Ambient Sound and/or an Ambient Light to a Tile. The region takes the visible (alpha) outline of the tile's image; all companions follow the tile when it is moved, resized, rotated, flipped, hidden or deleted. System-agnostic.",
